            "comprehends": [
             "copies/qz671pq0609#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded high on the figures of the date: every figure is plain. Pencil, read from the lower (180-degree) panel. Five figures run together without separators, 9 11 22; the first has a closed bowl and a descender and is a 9, then two plain upright strokes, then two cursive 2s. Nothing else is written in the crop."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
       "medium": "pencil"
      }
     ]
